@startuml
title ATM Withdrawal Process

state Initial
state PredefinedAmountSelection
state CustomAmountEntry
state CancelTransaction
state TransactionCompleted

Initial --> PredefinedAmountSelection : Choose predefined amount
Initial --> CustomAmountEntry : Enter custom amount

PredefinedAmountSelection --> TransactionCompleted : Proceed with transaction
CustomAmountEntry --> TransactionCompleted : Proceed with transaction

[*(Initial)] --> Initial : On startup

PredefinedAmountSelection --> CancelTransaction : Cancel
CustomAmountEntry --> CancelTransaction : Cancel
CancelTransaction --> Initial : Return
@enduml
